{
  "version": 1,
  "description": "Semantic click-swap pairs. Each entry is [from, to, mode]. The reverse entry is generated automatically unless an explicit reverse exists. `mode` picks the CSS transition: mirror = horizontal flip (arrows/chevrons), flip = vertical flip (up/down), rotate = 90deg (more-horizontal/vertical, sun/moon), slide = cross-slide, fade = cross-fade + scale.",
